ocedures established by the Administrator of General Services.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); Sec. 3","sha256":"d2b0a70a66174f1c36f62e86315853055e0f830c697b7084bc0e642aa1409be8","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12869-continuance-certain-federal-advisory-committees"},"scope_id":"EO:12869#sec3","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 4. The following Executive orders or sections thereof, which established committees that have terminated or whose work is completed, are revoked:","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); Sec. 4 (lead-in)","sha256":"d2b0a70a66174f1c36f62e86315853055e0f830c697b7084bc0e642aa1409be8","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12869-continuance-certain-federal-advisory-committees"},"scope_id":"EO:12869#sec4","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a)\n\nExecutive Order No. 12792, establishing the National Commission on America’s Urban Families;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); Sec. 4(a)","sha256":"d2b0a70a66174f1c36f62e86315853055e0f830c697b7084bc0e642aa1409be8","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12869-continuance-certain-federal-advisory-committees"},"scope_id":"EO:12869#sec4(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b)\n\nExecutive Order No. 12813, as amended by Executive Order No. 12815, establishing the President’s Commission on the Management of the Agency for International Development (AID) Programs;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an offi